{"id":94,"slug":"ma-jain-zh","resourceId":56,"nameNative":"马坚译（中文）","nameAr":"ما جيان","nameEn":"Chinese Translation (Ma Jian)","lang":"zh","source":"Quran.com API v4","sourceUrl":"https://quran.com","verses":[{"verseNumber":1,"verseKey":"94:1","text":"难道我没有为你而开拓你的胸襟吗？"},{"verseNumber":2,"verseKey":"94:2","text":"我卸下了你的重任"},{"verseNumber":3,"verseKey":"94:3","text":"即使你的背担负过重的，"},{"verseNumber":4,"verseKey":"94:4","text":"而提高了你的声望，"},{"verseNumber":5,"verseKey":"94:5","text":"与艰难相伴的，确是容易，"},{"verseNumber":6,"verseKey":"94:6","text":"与艰难相伴的，确是容易，"},{"verseNumber":7,"verseKey":"94:7","text":"当你的事务完毕时，"},{"verseNumber":8,"verseKey":"94:8","text":"你应当勤劳，你应当向你的主恳求。"}]}